    "sections": {
        "description": "Legacy Preschool Kindergarten is a versatile theme specifically crafted for early education websites, including preschools, kindergartens, daycare centers, and child-focused learning programs. With a clean and minimal layout, this theme boasts a responsive design that seamlessly adapts to desktops, tablets, and mobile devices, making it ideal for e-learning environments. It incorporates essential sections typical of educational websites, such as a banner area, testimonial section, staff/team showcase, and call-to-action buttons. Additionally, the theme supports social media integration and is translation-ready for multilingual use, enhancing accessibility in education. Developers and site owners can easily customize layouts, colors, and content through built-in options and shortcodes. Utilizing Bootstrap for a structured framework, the optimized code ensures stable performance. The theme also features retina-ready support for clear image display on high-resolution screens, while selective animations add subtle interaction effects without overwhelming the interface. Overall, this theme is perfect for educational websites seeking an organized, adaptable, and user-friendly design."
    },
